'''Grizzly Salmon''' is a {{Rare}} item used to make the [[Hunter Ring]]. It is a {{Odds|Pray RNGesus|nameonly=y}} drop from {{SlayerTier|IV}} [[Sven Packmaster]]s.

== Obtaining ==
'''Grizzly Salmon''' has a {{Chance|0.054%|7|13,000}} drop rate from the [[Sven Packmaster]] {{SlayerTier|IV}}. It requires {{Collection|Wolf Slayer 7}} to drop.

